==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage acts as a check for knowing how to meatshield, as the Bore is a very threatening enemy with a lot of pushing power. Since most of the threats here are red, [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] and/or [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]] can be very useful here.

The strategy is to kill the first One Horn before the Bore reaches your frontline by utilizing high DPS units against red enemies like Frog Ninja Cat, [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and/or [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Sword Master Cat]]. Once the Bore spawns, you can spawn Crowd Control units such as [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] and [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] to prevent it from pushing too far into your defense while you are continuing to spawn high DPS units. It is also recommended to have all Superior [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]] when attempting this stage.

[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Flashing Dancer Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]], [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]], and other Super Rare gacha answers to Red enemies are great here. This is especially true for Flashing Dancer, being able to nuke the One Horns and Kang Roos.

If you were unlucky with your [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] pulls and didn't recieve any anti-Red units, try to use high DPS units to out-DPS the Bore and its support such as [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]], [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Otherwise you can try this stage later until you got some anti-Red units.

